OL,3,AFed has 'work to do' if price rises
OL,4,Adon't ease for Americans, Warsh says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the US central bank said
OL,7,Fpolicymakers will "have work to do" to
OL,8,Fif they are not confident cost of
OL,9,Fliving pressures are easing for
OL,10,FAmericans.
OL,12,FFederal Reserve chairman Kevin Warsh
OL,13,Fsaid while inflation readings looked
OL,14,Fbetter than expected over the summer,
OL,15,Fthey did not show that the current
OL,16,Fpicture had "meaningfully improved".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
